### run 1
binCV SIMD: NEON=NO AVX2=yes popcount=hardware (fast paths active)
LK residual kernel: AVX2, eight keypoints per batch
LK keypoint batch: off

=== a / pipeline over 1710 frames, 752x480 ===
both pipelines see bit-identical input: median_filter then rl_fast_edge_filter_wide(17)

